[statement]
A carried name whose candidate depends on a name a candidate of another
carried name provides is not decided before that one: `p1`, which `app`
lists last, is decided first, though `b` needs `x`, which `p1` provides.
`b`'s requirement on `x` at 1.0 then breaks `p1`, and apk refuses.
Contrast `a-requirer-reaches-through-the-names-a-candidate-provides`.

[repository]
P:app
V:1
D:b p1

P:p1
V:1
k:5
p:x

P:b
V:1
D:x=1.0

[request]
app

[answer apk-tools 3.0.9-r0]
| ERROR: unable to select packages:
|   p1-1:
|     breaks: b-1[x=1.0]
|     satisfies: app-1[p1]
refused
